            <div xml:id="d332">

                <pb facs="0716" n="596" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg596"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">875.01/191: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Child</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-04-24T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 24,
                                1922—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>52. Your confidential despatch No. 251 April 3. Report by telegraph countries
                    which have recognized Albania, whether <hi rendition="#italic">de facto</hi> or
                        <hi rendition="#italic">de jure</hi> recognition has been given and the
                    exact designation of representatives who have been sent.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
